{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:8b851db18ce367c0","name":"The Maker","source":{"id":"source:reference-8b851db18ce367c0","title":"The Maker","revision":24554,"timestamp":"2024-11-03T19:37:18Z","sha256":"fa08d84983d8794617c5c5686e57e817d5460bd177d222bf381f737f1d2ae269","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=24554","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=The%20Maker&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-8b851db18ce367c0","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Scavenger's Guide to Droids"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Scavenger%27s_Guide_to_Droids"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The origin of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droids"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droids","referenceId":"reference:6e72e583603b9ea8"}," is lost to the mists of history. Some ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droids"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droids","referenceId":"reference:6e72e583603b9ea8"}," believe the story of The Maker. Creator of the first ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droid"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droid"},", The Maker pushed ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droids"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droids","referenceId":"reference:6e72e583603b9ea8"}," from simple machines to intelligent creations. Some ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droids"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droids","referenceId":"reference:6e72e583603b9ea8"}," hold that The Maker was the first ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droid"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droid"},". These conflicting views sometimes cause unrest among the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droids"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droids","referenceId":"reference:6e72e583603b9ea8"}," that believe in The Maker. Nothing more than spirited debate comes of it, but of the galaxy's war-torn sectors know the destruction that can result from fervently held beliefs.\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
